---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Engineering Projects" description="Technical project evidence supporting James Roberts' infrastructure and systems engineering skills.">
  <section class="page-intro"><div class="container section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Engineering Projects</p><h1>Infrastructure and systems engineering projects.</h1><p>Focused case studies showing how technologies have been designed, implemented and operated. Current, planned and historical work is kept distinct.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section-soft"><div class="container project-grid">
    <a class="project-card featured" href="/projects/engineering-platform"><span>Current · Core Platform</span><h2>Engineering Platform</h2><p>The overall environment: infrastructure, automation, observability, security, public delivery and operational practice.</p><strong>View evidence →</strong></a>
    <a class="project-card" href="/projects/proxmox-platform"><span>Live</span><h2>Proxmox VE</h2><p>Two-node clustering, quorum, Corosync networking, LXC/QEMU workloads, backup and recovery.</p><strong>View Proxmox case study →</strong></a>
    <a class="project-card" href="/projects/docker-platform"><span>Live · Refreshing case study</span><h2>Docker &amp; Komodo</h2><p>Container deployment, Compose, lifecycle management, monitoring and controlled updates across the current platform.</p><strong>View Docker work →</strong></a>
    <a class="project-card planned" href="/projects/kubernetes"><span>Planned Return</span><h2>Kubernetes / K3s</h2><p>Previous hands-on Kubernetes experience retained as evidence; a new deployment will document the technology against the current platform.</p><strong>View Kubernetes history →</strong></a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.page-intro h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5.5rem);letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1}.project-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.25rem}.project-card{display:block;padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--surface);text-decoration:none}.project-card.featured{grid-column:1/-1;border-color:rgba(93,184,255,.45)}.project-card>span{color:var(--primary);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.project-card h2{margin:.5rem 0;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.5rem)}.project-card p{color:var(--text-muted);max-width:760px}.project-card strong{color:var(--primary)}.planned{border-style:dashed}@media(max-width:700px){.project-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.project-card.featured{grid-column:auto}}
</style>